# Goal
# Ordered ground waypoints to follow, normalized image space (point.x, point.y in
# [-1, 1], center = 0; z unused), nearest-first — the PlanTrajectory.markers /
# SetWaypoints layout. Handed straight to waypoint_tracker's set_waypoints.
geometry_msgs/Point[] waypoints
# Frame to initialise tracking on; {sec: 0, nanosec: 0} uses the next frame.
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
---
# Result
bool success
string message
---
# Feedback
string state
